#. いや、戦刃むくろは、
#. 戦場で<CLT 3>傷なんて受けていなかった<CLT>んだ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, Mukuro didn't <CLT 3>suffer those wounds<CLT> in battle."
msgstr ""

#. それは、学園長室で見つけたファイルにも、
#. ちゃんと書いてあったはずだよ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The file we found in the headmaster's room said as\n"
"much."
msgstr ""

#. フェンリルの一員として、
#. 幾多の戦場を渡り歩いたにも関わらず…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Despite the time she spent in battle after battle as a\n"
"member of Fenrir..."
msgstr ""

#. 入学時の彼女の体には、
#. 傷らしい傷が<CLT 3>１つもなかった<CLT>って。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...when she entered this school, she <CLT 3>hadn't sustained\n"
"a single injury<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. こ、ここまで完璧に否定されると…
#. 逆に…なんだか清々しいわね…！
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"T-To be denied so completely... Actually, it's k-kind\n"
"of refreshing!"
msgstr ""

#. はっ…！　こ、これが白夜様の…調教の成果…！？
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "*gasp* M-Maybe it's cuz of all of Master's t-training!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …とにかく、戦刃むくろの全身にあった傷は、
#. すべて<CLT 3>入学後<CLT>のものだったんだよ。
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Anyway... So we can be sure that Mukuro suffered all\n"
"those wounds <CLT 3>after coming to this school<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、それが致命傷だった可能性も
#. あるはずだよね？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In which case, they could be the very thing that\n"
"killed her!"
msgstr ""

#. むしろ、他の可能性の方が考えられないわね…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, it's hard to imagine any other\n"
"possibility."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の死体を調べた限りだと、
#. 腹部の傷も後頭部の傷も<CLT 3>“死後に受けた傷”<CLT>だったわ。
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When examining her body, I found that her stomach and\n"
"head wounds came <CLT 3>after she was already dead<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 他の可能性がないなら…
#. もう、間違いないんじゃないかな…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Unless anyone has any better suggestions, I think we\n"
"can say this with confidence..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の全身にあった数多くの傷、
#. それこそが、戦刃むくろの<CLT 3>致命傷<CLT>だったんだよ！
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The wounds Mukuro sustained all over her body are what\n"
"<CLT 3>ultimately killed her<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>戦刃むくろの致命傷<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Mukuro's Fatal Injury<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でもよ、戦刃むくろの致命傷が
#. あの全身の傷だとすると…
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But if that's what killed her..."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろが殺された事自体が、
#. ここ数日じゃないってのも、マジなんだな！？
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"...then does that mean she's really been dead for who\n"
"knows how long!?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、そうなるね。
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's exactly what it means."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達が植物庭園で死体を発見した時、
#. 彼女の死体は、すでに<CLT 3>死後何日か経過<CLT>してたんだよ。
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When we found her body in the garden, she'd already\n"
"been <CLT 3>dead for several days<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、その前の晩の件はどうなる？
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So then, what about the little matter of what happened\n"
"last night?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体が発見された前の晩、
#. 苗木は、<CLT 3>覆面の人物に襲われた<CLT>と言っていたな…
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Makoto, you said you were attacked in your room by <CLT 3>a\n"
"masked assailant<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろが何日か前に殺されていたのなら、
#. その時の覆面の正体が、あいつだとは考えられん。
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If Mukuro had already been dead for several days,\n"
"certainly it couldn't have been her."
msgstr ""

#. では、苗木を襲った覆面の人物とは、
#. 何者だったんだ？
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So who was it that attacked you?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The mastermind"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Mukuro"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろが何日か前に殺されていたのなら、
#. その時の覆面の正体が、あいつだとは考えられん。
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If Mukuro had been dead for several days at least,\n"
"it's hard to imagine she was your assailant."
msgstr ""

#. 俺はそう言ったはずだが、
#. それを覆す証拠があるという事か？
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Not that I even need to ask, but do you happen to have\n"
"any evidence that would prove otherwise?"
msgstr ""

#. どうなんだ？
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr ""

#. 証拠は…ない、かな…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I...don't, no."
msgstr ""

#. もう１度考えてみるよ…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better think about this again..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長
msgctxt "0031 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The headmaster"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、学園長はもっと前に死んでいる。
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, the headmaster was dead long before then."
msgstr ""

#. その可能性については、
#. あなたに説明したはずよ。
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We already talked about that, didn't we?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そっか…そうだった…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh yeah...true."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhu..."
msgstr ""

#. ホントは何もわかってないんだろ？
#. だから答えらんないんだろ？
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You don't know anything about anything! That's why you\n"
"can't say anything, isn't it!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷ…！
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクを襲ったのはアイツしかいない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one person who could have attacked me...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクを襲った覆面の正体…
#. それは…あいつ以外には考えられないはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The identity of the one who attacked me... I can't\n"
"think of anyone else...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あの覆面の正体は…<CLT 3>黒幕<CLT>だったんだよ。
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The one who attacked me...was the true <CLT 3>mastermind<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 植物庭園で見つけた戦刃むくろの死体が
#. 同じ覆面をかぶってたせいで…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When we discovered Mukuro in the garden wearing the\n"
"same mask..."
msgstr ""

#. あの時の覆面も戦刃むくろだったんだと、
#. 思い込んでたけど…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...I naturally assumed she must have been the one who\n"
"attacked me."
msgstr ""

#. でも、そうじゃなかったんだ。
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But I was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. あの覆面の正体は、戦刃むくろじゃなくて、
#. 黒幕だったんだよ！
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It wasn't her at all. It was the mastermind!"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0047 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahaha! Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで…笑ってんの…？
msgctxt "0048 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What are you laughing at...?"
msgstr ""

#. 大人しく聞いているのも飽きたから、
#. そろそろ、ボクも参加させてもらおうかなー！
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Oh, don't mind me. I'm just getting a little impatient\n"
"sitting here listening. I think I'm gonna jump in!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、さっそく質問するけどさぁ…
msgctxt "0050 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Let's start off with a nice, easy question."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンを襲ったのがボクだなんて、
#. そんなの、ただの<CLT 3>推測<CLT>でしょ？
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Your assumption that I attacked Makoto is just that,\n"
"right? An <CLT 3>assumption<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 覆面を被ってて、顔もわからないのに、
#. 中身が誰かなんてわかる訳ないもんね！
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You can't really know who was under that mask, can\n"
"you? I mean, that's the whole point of a mask!"
msgstr ""

#. あの覆面の正体は、戦刃むくろだよ！
#. むしろボクはそう思うよ！！
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"The true identity of the masked attacker is Mukuro\n"
"Ikusaba! At least, that's what I think!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ…そんなボクを納得させられる根拠は、
#. あるのかしらね…？
msgctxt "0054 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... Do you have any evidence that might convince\n"
"me otherwise?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、あの覆面の正体が戦刃むくろだとは、
#. 絶対に考えられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, there's no way Mukuro is the one that attacked\n"
"me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>たとえ、顔が見えなくったって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even if I didn't see their face...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの特徴と…
#. あの覆面の人物を照らし合わせてみれば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If you compare what we know about Mukuro to the masked\n"
"attacker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの特徴であるフェンリルの刻印と…
#. あの覆面の人物とを照らし合わせてみれば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro had a very obvious Fenrir tattoo. Comparing\n"
"that to the masked attacker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは明らかなはずだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...it should be obvious!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
